  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "State is not touched outside the Spot queue",
      "items": [
        "Because a tick enters the Spot queue, touching state inside a timer does not interleave with other processing. That is why no lock is needed.",
        "A worker uses another execution context, so it neither reads nor writes the Spot's state. Its result returns to the Spot queue and is applied there."
